-- Issue #9, as it was filed: a rule that reacts to an entity being created,
-- `when: o: Order.created`. The creation was recorded — `fresh.placed` held —
-- and the reaction never ran, so `Welcome fires` was undecided and the field
-- it writes was never written.

journey CreatedTriggerFires {
    cast:
        seed: Order
    1. placing an order creates one, which should be welcomed
        seed does Place(seed) on Shop
            creating fresh: Order
        then fresh.placed = true
        then Welcome fires
        then fresh.welcomes = 1
}
